cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, cite this version and its accompanying mathematical notes."
title: "tt-obstacle: Feasibility-preserving tensor-train approximation for discrete obstacle problems"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
authors:
  - name: "tt-obstacle contributors"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  NumPy research software for Q1 energy contractions, tensor-train rounding,
  positive envelope repairs, interaction projections, and small independent
  reference obstacle problems. Accompanied by exact-arithmetic derivations
  and reproducible floating-point audits; no general low-rank solver or
  interval certification is claimed.
